<title>ITALY: BASKETBALL-SEMIFINAL RESULTS IN FINAL FOUR CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-SEMIFINAL RESULTS IN FINAL FOUR CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the Final</p>
<p>Four European club basketball championship on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Olympiakos (Greece) 74 Ljubljana (Slovenia) 65 (halftime 37-32)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Olympiakos - David Rivers 28, Dragan Tarlac 10, Franco Nakic</p>
<p>10</p>
<p>Ljubljana - Vladimir Stephanie 12, Jaka Daneu 11, Dusan</p>
<p>Hauptman</p>
<p>10.</p>
<p>Barcelona (Spain) 77 Villeurbanne (France) 70 (halftime 38-36)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Barcelona - Sasha Djordjevic 17, Andres Jimenez 16, Xavier</p>
<p>Fernandez 14</p>
<p>Villeurbanne - Delaney Rudd 20, Brian Howard 20</p>
